      "role": "user",
      "content": "Great. Here are the reviews:\n\n1. \"The battery life is insane! Lasted me two full days.\"\n2. \"The camera is okay, but the screen is a bit dim in sunlight.\"\n3. \"Amazing display, very bright colors. Best screen I've had.\"\n4. \"Disappointed in the build quality. Feels plasticky.\"\n5. \"The X-200 is a powerhouse. Fast processing and great multitasking.\"\n6. \"Camera is mediocre. Not worth the upgrade from the X-100.\"\n7. \"Love how light it is! Very comfortable to hold.\"\n8. \"Screen is stunning, but it's a fingerprint magnet.\"\n9. \"Battery dies way too fast when using GPS.\"\n10. \"The software is buggy. Crashed twice in the first hour.\"\n11. \"Great value for the price. Very impressed.\"\n12. \"The charging speed is slow. Takes forever to get to 100%.\"\n13. \"Face unlock is super fast and reliable.\"\n14. \"Speaker quality is disappointing. Sounds tinny.\"\n15. \"The X-200 has a beautiful display. Colors pop.\"\n16. \"Fingerprint sensor is hit or miss. Sometimes it won't read.\"\n17. \"Heavy phone. My wrist gets tired after long use.\"\n18. \"The zoom on the camera is incredible. Sharp photos.\"\n19. \"Overheats slightly during gaming sessions.\"\n20. \"Best smartphone I've owned in years.\"\n21. \"The design is sleek and modern. Love the matte finish.\"\n22. \"Screen is quite dim. I struggle to see it outdoors.\"\n23. \"Fast charging is a lifesaver, though it's not the fastest on the market.\"\n24. \"Software updates are frequent and helpful.\"\n25. \"The X-200 is a bit bulky for my hands.\"\n26. \"Audio is crisp. Great for watching movies.\"\n27. \"The interface is very intuitive. Easy to use.\"\n28. \"Battery life is just average. Nothing special.\"\n29. \"The camera's low light performance is stellar.\"\n30. \"Not a fan of the notch design. It's distracting.\"\n31. \"The X-200 feels premium in the hand.\"\n32. \"The screen is the best part of this phone. Truly immersive.\"\n33. \"I've had issues with the Wi-Fi connectivity dropping.\"\n34. \"Great gaming phone. No lag at all.\"\n35. \"The colors of the phone are beautiful.\"\n36. \"It's a bit expensive, but worth it for the features.\"\n37. \"The X-200 is quite powerful. Handles everything with ease.\"\n38. \"The camera shutter lag is annoying.\"\n39. \"I love the new UI. It's so smooth.\"\n40. \"The X-200 is a bit heavy, but that's expected with a big battery.\"\n41. \"The screen brightness is excellent.\"\n42. \"The build quality is top-notch. Feels very solid.\"\n43. \"The X-200 is a great all-rounder.\"\n44. \"The facial recognition is a bit slow sometimes.\"\n45. \"The screen is very responsive to touch.\"\n46. \"I'm really enjoying the X-200 so far.\"\n47. \"The battery charging is a bit slow for my liking.\"\n48. \"The X-200 has a great camera system.\"\n49. \"The phone's design is very appealing.\"\n50. \"Overall, a very solid smartphone experience.\"\n\nPlease provide the summary. Remember, I need detail, so aim for a high word count, but make sure it's all actually useful information about the reviews. Don't waste words.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
